{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33757","headline":"正乐府十篇 路臣恨 · 皮日休","name":"正乐府十篇 路臣恨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"路臣何方来，去马真如龙。\n行骄不动尘，满辔金珑璁。\n有人自天来，将避荆棘丛。\n狞呼不觉止，推下苍黄中。\n十夫掣鞭策，御之如惊鸿。\n日行六七邮，瞥若鹰无踪。\n路臣慎勿愬，愬则刑尔躬。\n军期方似雨，天命正如风。\n七雄战争时，宾旅犹自通。\n如何太平世，动步却途穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33757.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33757","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}